<div id="disclaimer-overlay" class="modal-base-overlay">
  <div
    id="disclaimer-box"
    class="w-[90%] max-w-[600px] max-h-[90vh] rounded-lg shadow-lg flex flex-col overflow-hidden border"
    style="background: var(--bg-secondary); border-color: var(--border-primary);"
  >
    <div class="bg-[#fef2f2] border-b border-[#fecaca] px-5 py-4 text-app-red-dark font-bold flex items-center gap-2.5">
      <span class="text-[1.5rem]">⚠️</span>
      <span data-i18n="modals.disclaimer.title">IMPORTANT SAFETY &amp; LEGAL DISCLAIMER</span>
    </div>
    <div class="p-5 px-6 overflow-y-auto text-[0.85rem] leading-relaxed [&_p]:mt-0 [&_p]:mb-4 [&_ul]:pl-6 [&_ul]:mb-4 [&_ul]:-mt-2 [&_li]:mb-2 [&_li]:pl-1" style="color: var(--text-primary);">
      <p><strong data-i18n="modals.disclaimer.readCarefully">PLEASE READ CAREFULLY BEFORE USING THIS SOFTWARE.</strong></p>
      <p>
        <strong data-i18n="modals.disclaimer.section1Title">1. "AS IS" / GPL / NON-COMMERCIAL USE</strong><br />
        <span data-i18n="modals.disclaimer.section1Body">This software ("Battery Tool") is a <strong>visualization aid</strong> for hobbyists. It is <strong>NOT</strong> professional engineering software and does not perform certification-level calculations for thermal dissipation, current path resistance, fuse ratings, or similar safety-critical parameters.<br />
        The software is provided <strong>"AS IS", without warranty of any kind</strong>, express or implied. It is licensed under the <strong>GNU General Public License v3.0</strong>.</span><br />
        <em class="block mt-1.5" style="color: var(--text-tertiary);" data-i18n="modals.disclaimer.section1Note">
          The software is provided free of charge. Any voluntary donations or support (e.g., via "Buy Me a Coffee") do not constitute a commercial transaction, sale, or business activity, and do not alter the non-commercial, hobbyist nature of this project.
        </em>
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong data-i18n="modals.disclaimer.section2Title">2. NOT PROFESSIONAL ADVICE</strong><br />
        <span data-i18n="modals.disclaimer.section2Body">Designs visualized here do not constitute professional engineering or electrical advice. You agree that you will not rely solely on this software for the construction of high-energy devices. <strong>Always</strong> have your designs reviewed by a qualified electrical engineer or other appropriately certified professional before construction.</span>
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong data-i18n="modals.disclaimer.section3Title">3. HIGH RISK WARNING</strong><br />
        <span data-i18n="modals.disclaimer.section3Body">Lithium batteries can cause <strong>fires, explosions, severe injury, property damage, and death</strong> if mishandled or improperly designed. By using this software, you acknowledge and agree that:</span>
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li data-i18n="modals.disclaimer.section3Item1">You are solely responsible for ensuring your battery pack complies with all local and international regulations (e.g., <strong>UN38.3, IATA</strong> shipping standards) and safety certifications (e.g., <strong>UL, IEC</strong>).</li>
        <li data-i18n="modals.disclaimer.section3Item2">This software does not check for regulatory compliance.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        <strong data-i18n="modals.disclaimer.section4Title">4. USER COMPETENCE &amp; AGE</strong><br />
        <span data-i18n="modals.disclaimer.section4Body">This tool is intended for use by adults (18+) with advanced knowledge of electrical safety and battery chemistry. If you lack this knowledge, <strong>do not</strong> attempt to build a battery pack.</span>
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong data-i18n="modals.disclaimer.section5Title">5. DATA ACCURACY</strong><br />
        <span data-i18n="modals.disclaimer.section5Body">The "Cell Database" contains crowdsourced snapshots provided <strong>without verification or warranty</strong>. The author makes no representations regarding the accuracy of third-party contributions. YOU must verify all specifications against official manufacturer datasheets before use.</span>
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong data-i18n="modals.disclaimer.section6Title">6. INDEMNIFICATION</strong><br />
        <span data-i18n="modals.disclaimer.section6Body">To the fullest extent permitted by law, you agree to <strong>indemnify, defend, and hold harmless</strong> the author (Steve Moya Cepeda) and contributors from any claims, damages, liabilities, costs, or expenses (including legal fees) arising from your use of this software, any battery pack constructed based on these visualizations, or any reliance on voluntary support mechanisms associated with the project.</span>
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong data-i18n="modals.disclaimer.section7Title">7. JURISDICTION</strong><br />
        <span data-i18n="modals.disclaimer.section7Body">This disclaimer is governed by the laws of <strong>Malta</strong>. If any provision is held invalid, the remainder shall continue in full force.</span>
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="px-5 py-4 border-t flex justify-end" style="border-color: var(--border-primary); background: var(--bg-tertiary);">
      <button
        id="btn-agree"
        class="bg-app-red-dark text-white border-none py-2.5 px-5 rounded-md font-semibold cursor-pointer text-[0.9rem] w-full hover:bg-red-800"
      >
        <span data-i18n="modals.disclaimer.agreeButton">I Understand and Agree</span>
      </button>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
